sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(Claude Desktop/Code)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS edge
    participant MCP as rhoai-mcp Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDC Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Registry as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Catalog as Model Catalog<br/>8080/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Agent,MCP: Flow 1: MCP Tool Call (OIDC Multi-User Mode)
    Agent->>Route: SSE/HTTP MCP Request<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (OIDC JWT)
    Route->>MCP: Forward (TLS terminated)<br/>HTTP/8000
    MCP->>OIDC: JWKS Discovery<br/>GET /.well-known/openid-configuration
    OIDC-->>MCP: JWKS Keys (RS256/ES256)
    Note over MCP: Validate JWT<br/>Extract user identity<br/>Set UserContext
    MCP->>K8s: SubjectAccessReview<br/>Check user RBAC permissions
    K8s-->>MCP: Allowed/Denied
    Note over MCP: Filter available tools<br/>based on user permissions
    MCP->>K8s: Execute K8s operation<br/>Auth: User's Bearer Token (forwarded)
    K8s-->>MCP: Resource response
    MCP-->>Route: MCP Tool Result
    Route-->>Agent: HTTPS Response

    Note over MCP,Catalog: Flow 2: Model Registry Discovery
    MCP->>K8s: List ModelRegistry CRs<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>MCP: ModelRegistry resources
    MCP->>K8s: Get Routes for registries<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    K8s-->>MCP: Route endpoints
    MCP->>Registry: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/...<br/>Auth: OAuth / Bearer token
    Registry-->>MCP: Model metadata

    Note over MCP,Catalog: Flow 3: Planner Model Recommendation
    MCP->>Catalog: GET benchmarks<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    Catalog-->>MCP: Benchmark data
    Note over MCP: llm-d-planner processes<br/>hardware + use-case requirements
    MCP-->>Agent: Model recommendation result
